<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><!-- Seer eye with the radar beam. Shared by the analyzing, unread and ready states, which differ only in how fast @animator/buddy_radar_* rotates the "beam" group. Head and eye paths must stay in sync with ic_buddy_eye.xml. Colours are literal, not @color refs: the aapt gradient forces build-time PNG generation for API 21-23, which cannot resolve resource references. -->
